content:
Help me define subdomains. Below I will provide the current state of the domain. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Person or organization requesting workflow automation"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review Request",
      "description": "Initial request to examine tasks and processes for automation potential",
      "attributes": [
        "Task",
        "Process Documentation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Task",
      "description": "Individual activity within the client’s workflow"
    },
    {
      "name": "Process Documentation",
      "description": "Material describing how the client’s current workflow operates"
    },
    {
      "name": "Automation Consultant",
      "description": "Specialist who analyzes workflows and designs automation"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workflow Analysis",
      "description": "Evaluation of client workflows to identify automation opportunities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workflow Automation Plan",
      "description": "Proposed setup for automating parts of the workflow",
      "attributes": [
        "Automation Script"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Automation Script",
      "description": "Executable automation logic that performs tasks automatically"
    },
    {
      "name": "System Administrator",
      "description": "Person managing system permissions and operational stability"
    },
    {
      "name": "Software Permission",
      "description": "Access settings required for automation scripts to run"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workflow Supervision",
      "description": "Oversight activity ensuring automated workflows run smoothly"
    },
    {
      "name": "Performance Report",
      "description": "Summary of automation results and efficiency gains"
    },
    {
      "name": "Automation Feedback",
      "description": "Client input about improvements or issues with the automation"
    }
  ]
}
```
